OL,3,AShane Richie pleads not guilty to
OL,4,Adrink-driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FEastEnders actor Shane Richie has
OL,7,Fpleaded not guilty to a single charge
OL,8,Fof drink-driving in his Hyundai IX35.
OL,10,FThe 62-year-old, who has played Alfie
OL,11,FMoon in the BBC soap since 2002, was
OL,12,Farrested at a petrol station in Harlow,
OL,13,FEssex, on 29 July.
OL,15,FRichie, from Tadworth in Surrey, has
OL,16,Fappeared at Colchester Magistrates'
OL,17,FCourt via video link from a hotel room.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
