OL,3,AShane Richie pleads not guilty to
OL,4,Adrink-driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe actor - whose real name is Shane
OL,7,FRoche - spoke only to confirm his name,
OL,8,Faddress and plea. He is next due to
OL,9,Fappear for trial at the same court on
OL,10,F17 November 2027.
